            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for noticing this (and actually reading help page, for that matter :) ).\r\n\r\nIt was not an issue with module, but with example. The reason it selected inside next tag is because after initiating Visual mode with `v` the whole inner tag was already selected, so 'mini.ai' tried to search for another (using default \"cover_or_next\" search method).\r\n\r\nI've updated example so that it could showcase `tag` textobject.",
